Version 2.0:
- src/brain/attention.ts: the approach of its attention rules and many of their
  word lists follow AMP's src/gateway/attention.ts. The code is a new
  implementation, and the word lists were changed and extended.
- test/attention.test.ts and test/fixtures/name-corpus.json: a few test sentences
  come from AMP's test/attention.test.ts and test/asr.test.ts, with the name
